        <div class="title text-center">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-22310ceeaa&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;cep/components/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-04-27T19:44:38Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;POWER YOUR LEGACY&#34;}}" id="title-22310ceeaa" class="cmp-title">
    <h2 class="cmp-title__text">POWER YOUR LEGACY</h2>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-dd862871fa&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;cep/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-04-20T14:03:47Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p style=\&#34;text-align: center;\&#34;>As the Official Sports Drink of FIFA World Cup 2026™, POWERADE knows it takes more than skill to dominate the pitch — it takes endurance, focus, and the fuel to keep pushing until the final whistle. With 50% more electrolytes* than Gatorade Thirst Quencher, POWERADE is hydrating soccer&#39;s biggest names on the world&#39;s biggest stage.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p style=\&#34;text-align: center;\&#34;>*Per 12 fl oz: Powerade - 240mg (Sodium), 80mg (Potassium); Gatorade Thirst Quencher - 160mg (Sodium), 50mg (Potassium)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-dd862871fa" class="cmp-text">
    <p style="	text-align: center;
">As the Official Sports Drink of FIFA World Cup 2026™, POWERADE knows it takes more than skill to dominate the pitch — it takes endurance, focus, and the fuel to keep pushing until the final whistle. With 50% more electrolytes* than Gatorade Thirst Quencher, POWERADE is hydrating soccer&#39;s biggest names on the world&#39;s biggest stage.</p>
<p style="	text-align: center;
">*Per 12 fl oz: Powerade - 240mg (Sodium), 80mg (Potassium); Gatorade Thirst Quencher - 160mg (Sodium), 50mg (Potassium) </p>

</div>

    

</div>

        
    </div>

