<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-d49f75c72f&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;cep/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-02-18T15:23:20Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>*Per 12 fl oz: POWERADE - 240mg (Sodium), 80mg (Potassium); Leading Sports Drink - 160mg (Sodium), 50mg (Potassium).&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>**PER 20 FL OZ: POWERADE® POWER WATER – 520 mg (SODIUM), 150 mg (POTASSIUM); PROPEL – 270 mg (SODIUM), 70 mg (POTASSIUM)&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-d49f75c72f" class="cmp-text">
    <p>*Per 12 fl oz: POWERADE - 240mg (Sodium), 80mg (Potassium); Leading Sports Drink - 160mg (Sodium), 50mg (Potassium).</p>
<p>**PER 20 FL OZ: POWERADE® POWER WATER – 520 mg (SODIUM), 150 mg (POTASSIUM); PROPEL – 270 mg (SODIUM), 70 mg (POTASSIUM)</p>

</div>

    

</div>
