<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-1f56ba7d43&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;cep/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-05-01T17:48:08Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p style=\&#34;text-align: left;\&#34;>NO PURCHASE NECESSARY. A PURCHASE WILL NOT INCREASE YOUR CHANCES OF WINNING. Open only to legal residents of the 50 U.S./D.C. &amp;amp; Canada, 18 years of age/age of majority and older. Void where prohibited by law. Sweepstakes starts at 12:01 a.m. ET on 5/1/26 and ends at 11:59 p.m. ET on 7/19/26. Skill-testing question required in Canada. 1,052 total prizes. ARVs range $10,000 USD to $4.50 USD. Subject to Official Rules, including how to enter, prize details, odds, and restrictions, click &lt;a href=\&#34;http://www.coca-cola.com/us/en/legal/powerade-house-of-legends\&#34;>here.&lt;/a> Sponsor: The Coca-Cola Company, One Coca-Cola Plaza, Atlanta, GA 30313, USA.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-1f56ba7d43" class="cmp-text">
    <p style="	text-align: left;
">NO PURCHASE NECESSARY. A PURCHASE WILL NOT INCREASE YOUR CHANCES OF WINNING. Open only to legal residents of the 50 U.S./D.C. &amp; Canada, 18 years of age/age of majority and older. Void where prohibited by law. Sweepstakes starts at 12:01 a.m. ET on 5/1/26 and ends at 11:59 p.m. ET on 7/19/26. Skill-testing question required in Canada. 1,052 total prizes. ARVs range $10,000 USD to $4.50 USD. Subject to Official Rules, including how to enter, prize details, odds, and restrictions, click <a href="http://www.coca-cola.com/us/en/legal/powerade-house-of-legends">here.</a> Sponsor: The Coca&#x2011;Cola Company, One Coca&#x2011;Cola Plaza, Atlanta, GA 30313, USA.</p>

</div>

    

